<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Mitac Jan-Mar pretax turns to red.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Mitac Jan-Mar pretax turns to red.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				3,399 vs 3,761</p>
<p>    Pretax profit		     loss 29 vs    68</p>
<p>    Net profit			  loss 29 vs    68</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitac International Corp is a computer maker. It has set a 1997 pretax profit target of T$300.7 million on sales of T$17.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
